<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">The Surprising Effectiveness of Noise Pretraining 
<br class="ltx_break">for Implicit Neural Representations</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Kushal Vyas
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
