<span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_external">1801.03924</span></span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S8.p1.1" title="8 More results on image and video fitting ‣ The Surprising Effectiveness of Noise Pretraining for Implicit Neural Representations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§8</span></a>.
</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
