<figure id="S8.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S8.T7.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="S8.T7.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Image fitting results on OASIS-MRI.<span id="S8.T7.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We present mean PSNR(in db), SSIM and LPIPS with 1 std.dev. for all test methods at <math id="S8.T7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T=2000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T=2000</annotation></semantics></math> iterations, from vanilla randomly initialized (<span id="S8.T7.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Siren</span>), to data driven methods such as Metalearned <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">40</a>]</cite>, <span id="S8.T7.8.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Strainer</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib31" title="" class="ltx_ref">43</a>]</cite>, and <span id="S8.T7.8.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Snp</span> variants trained on structured and unstructured noises.</span></span></figcaption>
